          "tz": -480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21061 lov: list MDT pool members on clients",
        "message": "LU-21061 lov: list MDT pool members on clients\n\nClients drop MDT pool members: lov_pool_add() finds no OST with that\nname and the error is ignored, so lctl pool_list on a client does not\nshow them.  llapi also assumes a pool has no more members than there\nare OSTs: llapi_get_poolmembers() prints the \"Pool:\" header again when\nits caller retries with a larger buffer, and print_obd_quota() prints\nnothing for such a pool.\n\nKeep MDT members in pool_mdts on the LOV and list them after the OSTs\nin lov.*.pools.<pool>.  Print the pool header only once the members\nare read, and size the pool quota list for OSTs and MDTs, skipping\nthe MDTs.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=ost-pools\nSigned-off-by: Di Wang <diwa@nvidia.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 ltvm\nChange-Id: I4e50a1c829e7afdc9f2d37f0e85430f28c46f508\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
